   [2m# How bugfix works[0m

   [2m1. The lead reads the job and names who may edit which files.[0m
   [2m2. tester writes a test that fails for the bug's own reason, in `tests/`.[0m
   [2m3. coder fixes the code so that test passes, and never edits `tests/`.[0m

   [2m## Who edits what

[0m   [2m- One writer per file at a time; a member asks a file's owner directly.[0m
   [2m- Another run of a team may be working here: the leads agree on files.[0m

